{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in a space setting. Your main task is to complete each level without hitting any obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the pilot of a spaceship flying along a metal spline by the action of a magnetic cushion, which can rotate around the spline. Some obstacles are destructible. Such obstacles need to be smashed with a weapon or melted with a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is very beautiful and unique. Listen to the music and play in unison with it. The levels last an average of 3 minutes. Each of them has checkpoints that save the current progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly has a short story and a manual that describes all the functions and mechanics of the game (as the levels become more complex, new and/or more complex mechanics appear). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also purchase various coatings for your spaceship and more.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Galaxy Neovaii 50%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/5d7d5d3732dc5eefb5fdeb788d3f38835d5312b4.jpg"},{"name":"Wonderland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/de79da6f49b7585cdcb5596569154d1ea1a4ee9a.jpg"},{"name":"Rare cover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/5404def7c99372b634b281c2415a44d49db51ee9.jpg"},{"name":"How far away from us stars?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/348c59f86de0b8e26070a4329a49ffbd87e1bf69.jpg"},{"name":"And where to fly further?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/4c701ae9897b0eec0ecf93af5b15a3a12711b4bc.jpg"},{"name":"Galaxy Neovaii 100%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/6bc9ba0fc28dc7947a91e8c17397d1f8c4c12367.jpg"},{"name":"The beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/039a21f29fe5895077a03f9dc3e417666b294388.jpg"},{"name":"Feelings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/320544f8dd3fb4ebcdbc3b8ec8d3a79d6090d4be.jpg"},{"name":"The right way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/e5588eeb24a05817e9349f961a6cbb38aff42b7a.jpg"},{"name":"Refinement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814610/08a90f91179e8cfada213b48e6cd6ee74946c53f.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814610?t=1771079840","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/d75748cb8f67a10f659fb16e34776d88f93f92b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771079840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/6f96618de27ad44d31cb02a1986bec18465264ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771079840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/6f96618de27ad44d31cb02a1986bec18465264ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771079840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in a space setting. Your main task is to complete each level without hitting any obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the pilot of a spaceship flying along a metal spline by the action of a magnetic cushion, which can rotate around the spline. Some obstacles are destructible. Such obstacles need to be smashed with a weapon or melted with a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is very beautiful and unique. Listen to the music and play in unison with it. The levels last an average of 3 minutes. Each of them has checkpoints that save the current progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly has a short story and a manual that describes all the functions and mechanics of the game (as the levels become more complex, new and/or more complex mechanics appear). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also purchase various coatings for your spaceship and more.</p>","developers":["NanoFastFly"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/bf2e21e3a3c07ec63ff684a8c4e87bd397c398fe/header.jpg?t=1771079840","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814610/1242652982/5e437bd4bdff061583f12cb7ea989f88a4b2dc60/1753300473/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753302651","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814610/1242652982/5e437bd4bdff061583f12cb7ea989f88a4b2dc60/1753300473/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753302651","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814610/1242652982/5e437bd4bdff061583f12cb7ea989f88a4b2dc60/1753300473/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753302651","id":257157417,"name":"FastFly trailer v1.1+","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157417/93c3ce96aa4c276b642dde4c29306750ee929a57/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753302651"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814610/306117611/7d01558a3b5ac2f302eb78810